@startuml
title Booking status | FR-007/009 | BR-024–026/044–047
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam activityBorderColor #475569
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
state "Awaiting confirmation" as pending
state "Confirmed" as confirmed
state "Cancelled" as cancelled
[*] --> pending : Eligible Learner books, seat held for 15 minutes
pending --> confirmed : Learner confirms, payment processed afterward
pending --> cancelled : Hold expires or class is cancelled
confirmed --> cancelled : Teacher cancels or Teacher no-show is recorded
cancelled --> [*]
note right of confirmed
 Current gap: confirmation can exist before payment succeeds.
 Learners cannot cancel their own booking in the MVP.
end note
note bottom of cancelled
 Cancel an unpaid hold: release the seat.
 Cancel a confirmed booking: request an internal-credit refund.
end note
note left of pending
 Completed and Disputed booking statuses are named in code,
 but no implemented transitions to them are shown.
 Class completion has its own lifecycle.
end note
@enduml
